  "title": "GstComplianceTab GSTR-1 export blob URL not revoked in error path",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: ux. Severity: P2. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. The handleExport function creates a blob URL with createObjectURL, clicks a link to download, then revokes. However, if the user navigates away or the download fails silently, the a.click() may not trigger the download and the blob URL is revoked immediately after click. The a element is also never appended to the DOM (unlike App.tsx line 2222-2225 which properly appends/removes). Some browsers require the element to be in the DOM for click() to work.",
